# House Hlaalu: "Tarvyn Faren" (HH_EscortMerchant), Edryno Arethi, Vivec.
# Edryno enables the trader on the road outside Vivec (10); "travel together" sets him following (50); his own
# script (tarvynFollow) logs 70 once the player stands in "Pelagiad, Halfway Tavern" with him still following;
# Edryno pays (100). The escort really walks (worklog rule 6's exception: a long route around a large obstacle):
# to the river bank (16-19k, -60k) the Pelagiad road has no bridge over, a steered swim across it (the player's
# AI walk stalls once it swims: run hh11, 24819 -71005 -88), then on to the tavern door (each walk predicted: reached).
# `defend`: river creatures attack the swimmer, and Follow freezes while anything fights the player (run hh12).
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_escort_start
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask business
ask Tarvyn Faren
expect GetJournalIndex HH_EscortMerchant == 10
bye
approach 055AB01F
talk tarvyn faren
ask travel together
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_EscortMerchant == 50
bye
end

case hh_escort_walk
defend
walk 19008 -62986 268
until 3000 "tarvyn faren"->GetDistance player < 500
steer 16384 -59648 56
until 3000 "tarvyn faren"->GetDistance player < 500
walk 2507 -56048 1570
until 3000 "tarvyn faren"->GetDistance player < 500
activate 0544937B
until 600 GetJournalIndex HH_EscortMerchant >= 70
end

case hh_escort_done
run
player->PositionCell 145 -99 -86 0 "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House" == 1
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask Tarvyn Faren
expect GetJournalIndex HH_EscortMerchant == 100
bye
end
